{"ID":"20240513083346-rjlr0lh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083346-rjlr0lh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083346-rjlr0lh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513111237-xrz1ske\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513111237-xrz1ske\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513111237-xrz1ske\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:385,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:385\u0026#125;","title":"065","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123835"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513111237-xrz1ske","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 813px;","id":"20240513111237-xrz1ske","updated":"20240515123835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"060-6 L, ML"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"50+ 瘦小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/4/9"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳仍有痛，雙腋下淋巴仍腫，但較軟了，左側腫塊有出血塊，但比以前乾了。從香港來之後，左右兩側仍持續在脹，尤其左乳及腋下。走路時有針剌感。("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"師：繼續運動走路，痛要治到不痛，不痛要治到痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 體力尚好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 胃口好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 大便正常。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 足開始溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 睡好轉，可睡過六小時，以前只有三小時，但睡時仍有時會痛醒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 整日排氣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 呼吸順暢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 口渴，室溫水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、 晚上身熱仍有。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、 月經停了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方：同前。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合谷、太衝、外關、曲池、梁丘、肩井、足三里、上巨虛。(針義同前)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同3/24②方，加"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茜草三錢、炙鱉甲三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→乳頭正下方就是肝經，入肝軟堅，加強去瘀。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫根三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→針對胸腔之活血化瘀。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"絡石藤五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→多數用在喉癌及"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"淋巴系統高位"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"之症。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"師：此病人因其一直有「痛」，表示有「瘀」，為加強去瘀，今日故下茜草、紫根、絡石藤等藥。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}